 @Override protected void onDestroy(){permissionContinuation=null;if(confirmationDialog!=null){confirmationDialog.dismiss();confirmationDialog=null;}if(qrReader!=null)qrReader.detach(this);if(restore!=null)restore.detach(this);if(engine!=null)engine.detach(this);super.onDestroy();}
 @Override protected void onActivityResult(int code,int result,Intent data){super.onActivityResult(code,result,data);if(code==42){restore.installationReturned();return;}if(code==43){finishRestoreSetup();return;}if(code==LIVE_QR){if(result==RESULT_OK&&data!=null&&qrPickerEpoch==pairingEpoch&&!(engine.isActive()||restore.isActive()))read(data.getStringExtra("code"));qrPickerPending=false;return;}if(code==QR_IMAGE||code==QR_CAMERA){boolean valid=qrPickerPending&&qrPickerEpoch==pairingEpoch&&!(engine.isActive()||restore.isActive());qrPickerPending=false;if(!valid||result!=RESULT_OK||data==null)return;try{if(code==QR_IMAGE&&data.getData()!=null)qrReader.image(data.getData());else if(code==QR_CAMERA&&data.getExtras()!=null){android.graphics.Bitmap image=(android.graphics.Bitmap)data.getExtras().get("data");if(image==null)throw new IllegalArgumentException();qrReader.bitmap(image);}else qrState.setText(R.string.qr_failed);}catch(RuntimeException e){qrState.setText(R.string.qr_failed);}return;}if(result!=RESULT_OK||data==null)return;try{if(code==FILES){List<Uri> uris=new ArrayList<>();if(data.getClipData()!=null)for(int i=0;i<data.getClipData().getItemCount();i++)uris.add(data.getClipData().getItemAt(i).getUri());else if(data.getData()!=null)uris.add(data.getData());for(Uri uri:uris)try{getContentResolver().takePersistableUriPermission(uri,Intent.FLAG_GRANT_READ_URI_PERMISSION);}catch(SecurityException ignored){}engine.addUris(uris);}else if((code==FOLDER||code==TREE)&&data.getData()!=null){Uri uri=data.getData();if(!DocumentsContract.isTreeUri(uri))throw new SecurityException();getContentResolver().takePersistableUriPermission(uri,Intent.FLAG_GRANT_READ_URI_PERMISSION|(code==FOLDER?Intent.FLAG_GRANT_WRITE_URI_PERMISSION:0));if(code==FOLDER){engine.setDirectory(uri);queueAction("hotspot",()->withWifiPermission(()->withNetworkPermission(engine::createHotspot)));}else engine.scanTree(uri);}}catch(RuntimeException e){Toast.makeText(this,R.string.permission_denied,Toast.LENGTH_LONG).show();}}
 protected int dp(int n){return Math.round(getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density*n);}protected LinearLayout column(){LinearLayout l=new LinearLayout(this);l.setOrientation(LinearLayout.VERTICAL);return l;}
